  {
   "text": "Every time Rosie's dog lunged at a squirrel, the collar yanked his throat.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 4.406
  },
  {
   "text": "The fix: clip the leash to a padded harness, so a pull spreads across the chest,",
   "start": 4.506,
   "end": 9.124
  },
  {
   "text": "with a handle for logs and steps.",
   "start": 9.174,
   "end": 11.033
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for your next dog hike.",
   "start": 11.333,
   "end": 13.029
